  Why: 'The intro''s landing is kept: slip, wharf, dock, dory berth, dredged approach and arrival route do not move. It is framed by paint (a weed line on the slip''s flanks, a wrack line at the spring-high mark, shingle above) and by the forms either side: the strand to the north, the Harbour Stack to the south. (terrain pass 9 part 2, p2_data.py sha256 15750c11...; PR 5w, on the ground file: paint only)'
